{% comment %}
  Add to cart button for the PDP buy box, with the accelerated checkout row
  underneath it.

  Submits through Horizon's product-form-component that wraps the whole buy box,
  so the native cart drawer opens instead of a redirect to /cart. The form object
  has to be handed in because payment_button only works on the form it came from.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the add_to_cart block. Reads settings.label,
    settings.show_icon and settings.show_dynamic_checkout.
  - product {Object} - the product being sold.
  - current_variant {Object} - decides whether the button is buyable.
  - form_obj {Object} - the enclosing product form, for the payment button.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-atc__block',
    block: block,
    product: cwc_product,
    current_variant: current_variant,
    form_obj: form
  %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign atc_class = 'cwc_pdp-product__atc'
  unless block.settings.show_icon
    assign atc_class = atc_class | append: ' cwc_pdp-product__atc--no-icon'
  endunless
-%}

<div class="cwc_pdp-product__buy" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% render 'add-to-cart-button',
    add_to_cart_text: block.settings.label,
    class: atc_class,
    can_add_to_cart: current_variant.available,
    product: product
  %}

  {%- if block.settings.show_dynamic_checkout and form_obj != blank -%}
    <div class="cwc_pdp-product__dynamic">{{ form_obj | payment_button }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
